%% WeaveNYC — To-Be Conceptual: System Actors and Interactions
%% Source: 06_Blueprints.md §2.1

flowchart LR
  subgraph Users ["User Layer"]
    R[Resident App<br/>Help Seeker]
    H[Helper App<br/>Provider]
  end

  subgraph Community ["Community Layer"]
    A[Anchor Node<br/>+ Admin Console]
  end

  subgraph Cloud ["Cloud Layer"]
    C[Cloud Intelligence<br/>Match / Safety / Notify]
    D[(Directory DB<br/>Official Resources)]
  end

  R <-->|posts / matches| A
  H <-->|posts / matches| A
  A <-->|sync / aggregate| C
  C <-->|read / write| D
  D --> R

  style R fill:#FFE0B2,stroke:#E65100
  style H fill:#C8E6C9,stroke:#2E7D32
  style A fill:#CE93D8,stroke:#6A1B9A
  style C fill:#90CAF9,stroke:#1565C0
  style D fill:#B0BEC5,stroke:#37474F
